  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "The short answer",
      "items": [
        "Entra ID, Graph, Brevo, Slack, Teams, the LLM providers and Azure Blob are all optional",
        "Without them the app uses demo sign-in, in-app-only notifications, a hashed-embedding offline AI template, and database or local attachment storage"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Not shown here",
      "items": [
        "Sign-in and Entra ID, drawn in the identity diagram, and the inbound direction of each channel (see the inbound diagram)",
        "Connected but out of scope: Inbound webhook routes, REST API /api/v1, Channel adapters, Unified intake, AI resolver, SLA and routing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "orange",
      "title": "Risks",
      "items": [
        "Demo mode is the default and only switches off when Entra ID is configured or DEMO_MODE=false is set: a deployment that sets neither keeps header impersonation (x-actor, x-tenant), passwordless sign-in and open webhooks; the production environment check exists to catch this"
      ]
    }
  ]
